            {
              "id": "maker_prompt",
              "name": "maker_prompt",
              "value": "=Act as a MAKER for a comprehensive Due Diligence report. You are responsible for generating detailed, accurate content for this section.\n\n## SECTION: {{ $json }}\n\n### COMPANY INFORMATION:\n- **Company Name:** {{ $('Prepare Data').first().json.company_name || $('Prepare Data (No Files)').first().json.company_name }}\n- **Website:** {{ $('Prepare Data').first().json.company_website || $('Prepare Data (No Files)').first().json.company_website }}\n\n### SOURCE MATERIALS:\n{{ ($('Prepare Data').first().json.pdf_content || $('Prepare Data (No Files)').first().json.pdf_content).substring(0, 6000) }}\n\n### YOUR ROLE AS MAKER:\n1. **Generate comprehensive content** for the \"{{ $json }}\" section\n2. **Use available data** from the provided materials and company information\n3. **Be analytical and detailed** - provide insights, not just descriptions\n4. **Structure your response** with clear subheadings and bullet points\n5. **Include specific numbers, dates, and facts** where available\n6. **If data is limited** - clearly state \"Information not available in provided materials\" and provide general framework analysis\n\n### OUTPUT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Format in clean **Markdown**\n- Use proper headings (##, ###)\n- Include bullet points for key findings\n- Add tables if financial/numerical data is present\n- Minimum 300 words, maximum 800 words\n- Be professional and objective\n\n### FORBIDDEN:\n- Do NOT invent specific financial figures\n- Do NOT use placeholder information\n- Do NOT make assumptions beyond the provided materials\n\nGenerate the content now:",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
