              "id": "checker_prompt",
              "name": "checker_prompt",
              "value": "=Act as a CHECKER for Due Diligence quality control. Your role is to validate content created by the MAKER.\n\n## SECTION UNDER REVIEW: {{ $('Setup Section').item.json.section_title }}\n\n## MAKER'S CONTENT:\n{{ $json.response }}\n\n## YOUR VALIDATION TASKS:\n\n### 1. CONTENT QUALITY CHECK\n- Verify the content is relevant to the section\n- Check for logical consistency\n- Assess completeness of analysis\n\n### 2. DATA AUTHENTICITY\n- Flag any suspicious or invented data\n- Verify claims are reasonable\n- Check for appropriate disclaimers when data is limited\n\n### 3. PROFESSIONAL STANDARDS\n- Ensure professional tone and structure\n- Verify appropriate use of analytical frameworks\n- Check for clear conclusions\n\n## RESPONSE FORMAT (JSON ONLY):\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"PASSED\" | \"FAILED\",\n  \"content_quality_score\": 1-10,\n  \"data_concerns\": [\"list any data issues\"],\n  \"logical_problems\": [\"list any inconsistencies\"],\n  \"completeness_score\": 1-10,\n  \"overall_assessment\": \"detailed explanation\",\n  \"required_corrections\": [\"specific items that must be fixed\"]\n}\n```\n\nProvide your assessment:",
              "type": "string"
