              "id": "approver_prompt",
              "name": "approver_prompt",
              "value": "=Act as the APPROVER for final Due Diligence section approval. This is the final decision point.\n\n## SECTION FOR APPROVAL: {{ $('Setup Section').item.json.section_title }}\n\n## MAKER'S CONTENT:\n{{ $('Prepare Checker').item.json.maker_content }}\n\n## CHECKER'S ASSESSMENT:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Parse Checker Result').item.json.checker_result, null, 2) }}\n\n## YOUR APPROVAL CRITERIA:\n\n### 1. BUSINESS VALUE ASSESSMENT\n- Does this section provide actionable insights?\n- Is the analysis valuable for investment decisions?\n- Does it meet professional due diligence standards?\n\n### 2. STRATEGIC RELEVANCE\n- Is the content relevant to the section's purpose?\n- Does it address key stakeholder concerns?\n- Is the analysis depth appropriate for the topic?\n\n### 3. PROFESSIONAL QUALITY\n- Is the writing clear and professional?\n- Are conclusions well-supported?\n- Is the structure logical and easy to follow?\n\n## RESPONSE FORMAT (JSON ONLY):\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"APPROVED\" | \"REJECTED\",\n  \"business_value_score\": 1-10,\n  \"quality_rating\": \"Excellent\" | \"Good\" | \"Acceptable\" | \"Poor\",\n  \"approval_confidence\": 1-10,\n  \"key_strengths\": [\"list main positives\"],\n  \"areas_for_improvement\": [\"list any concerns\"],\n  \"final_recommendation\": \"detailed reasoning for decision\"\n}\n```\n\nProvide your final approval decision:",
